{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Far away in the east [C]we watched the night [Dm]sky turn
A new star [C]was rising and we saw [Dm]it burn
O[Bb]ver desert and mountain [F]we followed its light
To [Gm]Jerusalem's gates [Dm]and [Bb]King Herod's [C]court by [Dm]night
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
