{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
The king was [C]disturbed and Jerusalem [Dm]too
The scribes searched the [C]scrolls till they found what was [Dm]true
[Bb]In Bethlehem [F]of Judea [Gm]the ruler will be [Dm]born
